# The tracker graphs are published by the weekly price-tracking run (rsync onto the
# deployed docroot), not committed: a tracked binary in the deployed checkout would
# turn into a dirty-file conflict on the next `git pull --ff-only`.
# The .svg is the vector twin the page inlines for label-hover highlighting; it is
# published by the same run, so it is ignored here for the same reason.
/ram-prices/price_trends.png
/ram-prices/price_trends.svg
